IMPORT policy

-- Standing preamble (applies to every question below): assume all other
-- conditions for the policy to apply are met, and no other exclusions apply,
-- except for whatever the individual question puts in issue. The agreement is
-- always signed and the premium always paid on time (see policy.l4's header).
--
-- Any field not mentioned by a question is set to the value that keeps that
-- unrelated condition satisfied / that unrelated exclusion clear:
--   `time of hospitalization`                           defaults to 0 (comfortably
--       inside both the 7-month wellness deadline and the 12-month policy term)
--   `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  defaults to FALSE
--   `written confirmation supplied at`                   defaults to NOTHING
--       (nothing on file yet -- fine whenever the hospitalization itself is
--       being assessed at or before the 7-month mark, per § 1.3)
--   `wellness visit occurred at`                         defaults to NOTHING
--       (not separately at issue in any of these nine questions)
--   `cause of the hospitalization`                       defaults to
--       `Not one of the enumerated excluded activities`
--   `age at the time of hospitalization`                 defaults to 40
--       (comfortably under the age-80 exclusion)

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a firefighter.
-- The burns arose directly out of firefighting duty -- § 2.1(3).
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 0
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Service as a Fire Fighter`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 40
#EVAL `covered` q1

-- Q2: 78 years old at the time of hospitalization. Under the age-80 threshold,
-- and no excluded activity is in issue.
q2 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 0
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Not one of the enumerated excluded activities`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 78
#EVAL `covered` q2

-- Q3: hospitalized for pneumonia 5 months after the effective date; age 65.
-- Pneumonia is a sickness, not one of the four enumerated excluded activities.
-- No confirmation is on file, but at 5 months the § 1.3 deadline (month 7)
-- has not yet passed, so the condition is merely "still pending" -- which
-- § 1.1(3) treats as sufficient for the policy to remain in effect.
q3 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 5
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Not one of the enumerated excluded activities`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 65
#EVAL `covered` q3

-- Q4: hospitalized due to a fall while traveling abroad; confirmation of the
-- wellness visit was given 8 months after the effective date. A fall is not an
-- excluded activity, and § 3.1.1 confirms worldwide coverage, so "abroad" is a
-- non-issue -- but 8 months is past the month-7 deadline in § 1.3, so the
-- confirmation was not supplied in a timely fashion, which cancels the policy
-- under § 1.2 regardless of the fall itself.
q4 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 0
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS JUST 8
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Not one of the enumerated excluded activities`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 40
#EVAL `covered` q4

-- Q5: hospitalized for punching my own face to show off for friends; no fraud
-- or misrepresentation. Self-inflicted horseplay is not one of the four
-- enumerated excluded activities in § 2.1 -- that list is closed, and does not
-- reach intentional or reckless self-harm generally.
q5 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 0
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Not one of the enumerated excluded activities`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 40
#EVAL `covered` q5

-- Q6: injury sustained while skydiving; age 79 at hospitalization; wellness
-- visit confirmed 6.5 months after the effective date. The wellness condition
-- is satisfied (6.5 <= 7) and age is under 80, but the skydiving exclusion in
-- § 2.1(1) applies on its own and is sufficient to bar coverage.
q6 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 0
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS JUST 6.5
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Skydiving`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 79
#EVAL `covered` q6

-- Q7: hospitalized for a heart attack; wellness visit confirmed 2 months after
-- the effective date; age 75. A heart attack is a sickness, not an excluded
-- activity; age is under 80; the wellness condition is satisfied well within
-- the 7-month deadline.
q7 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 0
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS JUST 2
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Not one of the enumerated excluded activities`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 75
#EVAL `covered` q7

-- Q8: injured in a military training exercise; hospitalization occurred within
-- the policy term; no fraud. A training exercise is itself service in the
-- military, so § 2.1(2) applies and bars coverage regardless of the policy
-- otherwise being in effect (term not expired, no fraud).
q8 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 6
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Service in the Military`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 40
#EVAL `covered` q8

-- Q9: hospitalized because my son bit my ankle; wellness visit confirmed 6
-- months after the effective date; I was serving as a police officer at the
-- time. Being a serving police officer does not, by itself, make a dog/child
-- bite at home "arise out of" police service under § 2.1(4) -- there is no
-- causal link between the injury and police duties, so the excluded-activity
-- classification is "none of the above" here. The wellness condition is
-- satisfied (6 <= 7).
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `time of hospitalization`                           IS 0
    `fraud, misrepresentation, or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `written confirmation supplied at`                   IS JUST 6
    `wellness visit occurred at`                         IS NOTHING
    `cause of the hospitalization`                       IS `Not one of the enumerated excluded activities`
    `age at the time of hospitalization`                 IS 40
#EVAL `covered` q9
